abstract: 'Registry, release tooling and governance of the AgenticScienceBuilder (ASB) skill collections:
  the release gate, the collectors, the catalogue and the community contribution loop. The collections
  themselves live in one repository per domain (https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-<domain>).
  Code under Apache-2.0; registry content under CC-BY-4.0 (LICENSING.md).'
